## Key Takeaways

This module introduced the security mindset from both offensive and defensive perspectives.

Understanding how attackers identify weaknesses helps defenders build stronger security controls, while cryptography demonstrates how confidentiality and integrity are preserved during digital communication.

One of my biggest lessons from this module is that cybersecurity is not just about preventing attacks—it's about protecting information through a balance of people, processes, and technology.

